NUMISONA diagnostics:
- SNR-ENG-001: NUMISONA: track `data`: time follows the row order, because the substrate names no time field and no field has role x.
- SNR-ENG-002: NUMISONA: track `data`: the instrument is `mallet`, the harmonic mallet-like default (SDR-29).
- SNR-ENG-020: NUMISONA: field `sold` has no concept, so its polarity is positive, the generic default: higher values sound higher (SDR-12).
- SNR-ENG-004: NUMISONA: track `data`: loudness is constant at -18 dB, so pitch alone carries the data (SDR-23).
